    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abaana baNyasaye",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lolekhwo obuheeli obwa Seefwe yakhuheele shinga olwa buli, mbu ifwe okhulangwa mbu abaana baNyasaye; ne nolwa khuli khurio. Ne niko akachila eshialo nishirakhumanya ta, okhuba shishiamumanya ye ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaheelwa banje, bulaano khuli abaana baNyasaye, ne khushili okhufwimbulilwa shinga olwa khuliba. Khumanyile mbu ye olwa aliba nafwimbuulwe, khulifwanana ninaye; shichila khulimulola shinga olwa ali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buli mundu ouli nobunaayi buno obuli khuye, yeesiiya omwene, shinga ye olwa ali omusiiyikhu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.3.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buli mundu oukholanga ebionoono, abeetsanga omukhayi wamalako; obwonooni nibwo obukhayi bwamalako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne mumanyile mbu yabakalwa ebulafu khulwa okhuyiniaho obwonooni; kata muye mubulamwo obwonooni bwosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oumenyanga muye shiyoonoonanga ta; owonoonanga shiabeetsanga namuluutsi kata okhumumanya tawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.3.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baana batii inywe, mwirecheshe omundu yesi aleshe okhumushiamia. Oukholanga akobulunjishi niye omulunjishi, shinga ye olwa ali omulunjishi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oukholanga akobwonooni nowaSetani; okhuba Setani yoonoonanga okhurula khukhuchaaka. Ne niko akachila Omwana waNyasaye yabakalwa ebulafu, mbu amalilane enulimo chiaSetani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.3.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oweebulwa nende Nyasaye shiakholanga ebionoono ta, shichila imela yaNyasaye yimenyanga muye; kata shianyala okhwonoonanga ta, shichila yeebulwa nende Nyasaye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwikhuwa lino nimwo omwa abaana baNyasaye bamanyishilanga, khandi nende abaana baSetani; mbu ourakholanga akobulunjishi shiali owaNyasaye tawe, kata oyo ouraheelanga omwana wabwe ta yesi ario.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.3.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Heelanenje",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shichila lino nilio likhuwa elia mwahulila okhurula khukhuchaaka, mbu khuheelanenje; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "khuraba shinga Kaini, owali owomubii oyo, niyeera omwana wabwe, ta. Ne yamwira mbushiina? Shichila ebikhole bibie omwene biali ebibii, ne ebia omwana wabwe nabio biali ebiobuIunjishi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.3.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baana beefwe, murahuka eshialo nishiba nishimukiya ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khumanyile shinga olwa khwarula mukhufwa nikhwinjila mubulamu, shichila khuheelanga abalangwa mbu abaana beefwe. Ouraheelanga ta amenyanga mukhufwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oukiya omwana wabwe nomwiri; ne mumanyile mbu abulaho omwiri yesi owa obulamu bwobumeli bumenyanga muye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwikhuwa lino nimwo omwa khumanyiile obuheeli, mbu shichila yahaana obulamubwe khulweefwe; neefu khukhoyile okhuhaana obulamu bweefwe khulwabo abalangwa mbu abaana beefwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne ouba nali nemiandu echiomushialo shino, nalola omwana wabwe nali mubutambi, ne namwikalila omwoyokwe, obuheeli bwaNyasaye bumenya burie muye?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.3.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Okhuba neikholo nyumu imbeli waNyasaye",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baana batii inywe, khuleshenje okhuheeIanga namakhuwa kata nolulimi bionyene ta; ne khuheelenje nebikhole nobwatoto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwikhuwa lino nimwo omwa khulamanyila shinga olwa khuli abobwatoto, nikhulema omwoyo imbeliwe ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mwikhuwa liosi elia emioyo chikhukhalachilangamwo eshiina; shichila Nyasaye ashila emioyo chieefwe, naye yamanya kosi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.3.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaheelwa banje, emioyo chieefwe nichiba nichirakhukhalachila eshiina ta, khuba abeikholo nyumu imbeli waNyasaye; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne eshia khusaba shiosi khunyoolanga khuye, okhuba khuhulilanga amalakoke, nikhukholanga ako aka achama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.3.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino nilio lilakolie, mbu khusuubilile eliira liOmwanawe Yesu Kristo, nende okhuheelana, shinga olwa yakhulaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.3.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 3:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ouhulilanga amalakoke amenyanga muye, ne naye muye. Ne mwikhuwa lino nimwo omwa khumanyila shinga olwa amenyanga mwifwe, khulwa Roho oyo owa yakhuheelesia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.3.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
